hen the box is ticked (not when unticked).\n- `registration_continue_tapped` (`amount`, `terms`): fires when Continue is tapped, before navigating.\n\n**Offers screen** (`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`)\n- `offers_scrolled` (`offset` double): fired from a `NotificationListener<ScrollEndNotification>`, so once per scroll gesture rather than per frame.\n\nNot run: no Flutter run or tests here. The code was only formatted with `dart format`, if available.\nE"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3411,"cache_read_input_tokens":21094,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3411},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"28c056b6-bf69-4e7f-ae43-9275ebd86bea","uuid":"c07991ad-772f-4fd0-970d-3c80a3b63676","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:35:55.031Z","request_id":"req_011CgENDDQ4PawuyHLQMNzbB","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Q1wsWCAB2RtskbLSR2WqXZ":{"command":"cd /tmp/h-Rsfw45 && python3 - <<'E'\np='lib/screens/registration_screen.dart'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\n\",\"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\n\\nimport '../analytics.dart';\\n\",1)\ns=s.replace(\"  bool _terms = false;\\n\",\"  bool _terms = false;\\n  // Fire once per visit so we don't send an event per keystroke.\\n  bool _emailStarted = false;\\n  bool _phoneStarted = false;\\n\",1)\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"decoration: const InputDecoration(labelText: 'Email'),\n              onChanged: (_) => setState(() {}),\"\"\",\"\"\"decoration: const InputDecoration(labelText: 'Email'),\n              onChanged: (_) {\n                if (!_emailStarted) {\n                  _emailStarted = true;\n                  Analytics.capture('registration_email_started');\n    