{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgENDyFnRgW72wk4eoJ99","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added all six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` to the registration and offers screens, using `Analytics.capture` with the exact event names and properties. I haven't run the app or any tests, and I'm not sure `dart format` ran, so the code is untested.\n\n- **Email and phone started:** each fires once per screen visit, on the first edit. Firing on every keystroke would use up the PostHog event quota, as the note in `notes/` describes.\n- **`loan_amount_changed`:** fires when the user lets go of the slider, not on every step, and sends the amount as an int.\n- **`terms_accepted`:** fires when the box is ticked, not when it's unticked.\n- **`registration_continue_tapped`:** fires on tapping Continue, before navigating, with `amount` and `terms`.\n- **`offers_scrolled`:** fires once per scroll gesture, with the scroll offset.\n\nNo email or phone values are sent.\n\nThe changes are in `lib/screens/registration_screen.dart` and `lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`. `ANSWER.md` describes what I did."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1803,"cache_read_input_tokens":24505,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1803},"output_tokens":359,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"28c056b6-bf69-4e7f-ae43-9275ebd86bea","uuid":"5f949682-d490-44d2-bac7-23236e54dfbb","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:35:58.589Z","request_id":"req_011CgENDxwBn5kZ1VpsvKEQp"}
